  "observations": [
    "Agent.TickAsAI has only 41 bytes of managed IL in this installed artifact; its name alone does not identify all native combat AI.",
    "Mission.TickAgentsAndTeamsImp iterates agents and teams; Mission.TickAgentsAndTeamsAsync invokes the IMBMission boundary.",
    "Layered population representation avoids creating a native agent for every logical soldier; this is an implementation design, not proof of a higher native cap."
  ],
